---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../site.config.mjs';
const who = site.operator || `the operator of ${site.name}`;
---
<Base title="Privacy" description={`How ${site.name} handles your personal information.`}>
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Privacy</p>
    <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>This notice explains what {who} does with personal information collected through {site.name}.</p>
      <h2>Browsing the site</h2>
      <p>You can use the directory without giving us any personal information. We don’t use advertising cookies.</p>
      <h2>Site analytics</h2>
      <p>We use Microsoft Clarity to understand how people use the site, for example which pages are visited, where people click and how far they scroll, so we can improve it. Clarity only runs if you click “Accept” on our cookie banner. It then sets cookies and records usage data on Microsoft’s servers. You can change your choice at any time with “Cookie settings” at the bottom of every page. See <a href="https://privacy.microsoft.com/privacystatement" rel="noopener">Microsoft’s privacy statement</a> for how Microsoft handles this data.</p>
      <h2>Consultation requests</h2>
      <p>If you send a consultation request, we collect your name, email address, optional phone number, your area and the treatment you are considering. We use them only to pass your request to the clinic or clinics you asked us to contact, with your consent. Please don’t send medical details through the form.</p>
      <h2>Where we keep it</h2>
      <p>Requests are stored in our own lead inbox, hosted by Cloudflare, and are only seen by the {site.operator} team and the clinics you chose. To stop abuse we also keep a one-way scrambled code made from your connection address, not the address itself.</p>
      <h2>Newsletter</h2>
      <p>If you sign up to our email, we keep your email address to send it, until you unsubscribe or ask us to delete it.</p>
      <p>We keep requests for up to 12 months so we can answer questions about them, then delete them.</p>
      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>You can ask us for a copy of your information, ask us to correct or delete it, or withdraw your consent at any time{site.contactEmail ? <> by emailing <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a></> : ''}. You can also complain to the Information Commissioner’s Office at ico.org.uk.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
